 keepalive 2.0.0 · help

 a       activity on or off
 + -     15 min more or less
 ?       this help
 s esc   stop, back to Home
 q       stop and quit
 ctrl+c  stop and quit

 Simulate activity moves the pointer in small
 arcs (up to about 130 px) and back to where it
 was, once you have been idle for a while, so
 Teams and Slack keep showing you as Active.
 It pauses while you use the computer or the
 screen is locked; "keepalive doctor" checks
 that it works here.
 Logs: /home/u/.cache/keepalive/keepalive.log

 ? or esc close
